    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For Sale By Private Treaty. Large detached two storey house with outhouses on an elevated site with stunning views over Mulroy Bay. This property offers excellent location in a rural setting. Would make ideal family home \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance\n1.80m x 1.80m Ceramic tiled floor and stairs\n\nLounge\n4.80m x 3.60m Fireplace with wooden surround and tiled hearth, solid pine wood floor, T.V. Point\n\nLiving Room\n4.80m x 3.60m Ceramic tiled floor, fireplace with tiled hearth, fitted eye and low level units and fridge\n\nKitchen\n2.40m x 2.00m Fitted eye and low level units, ceramic tiled floor\n\nShower Room\n3.60m x 1.80m Triton Shower, W/C., W.H.B., tiled walls\n\nHotpress\n\n\nBedroom 1\n2.20m x 3.60m Semi-solid oak flooring, T.V. Point\n\nBedroom 2\n3.60m x 2.50m Semi-solid oak flooring, T.V. Point\n\nBedroom 3\n3.60m x 2.70m Semi-solid oak flooring, T.V. Point\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Gravel drive and parking\nLocal stone walls.\n3 Outhouses\n \n O.F.C.H.\nGravel drive and parking\nLocal stone walls. \n Kerrykeel has several amenities including National School, independent shops, bars and restaurants and post office. Within a short 10km drive of Portsalon with excellent beaches and Portsalon Golf Course."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER Number: 119652428"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Entering Kerrykeel from the Milford direction turn left on R246 and continue for 2.1 km then turn right for 350m then right again for 56m then take L1092 Ballymagowan Upper for 850m Slight left onto R247, turn right onto Ballymagowan Lower for 600m. Input eircode F92 APV2 into sat nav or smart phone to be taken to the property."
      }
